      <memberdef kind="define" id="active__object_8h_1a9e25162131c65528fc7663b099826e9e" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>ACTIVE_OBJECT_PRIO_TO_SIGNAL</name>
        <param><defname>prio</defname></param>
        <initializer>  ((<ref refid="active__object_8h_1a339614e2c6b3f80b5fe15771a41be17f" kindref="member">activeObject_eventSignal_t</ref>)(<ref refid="active__object_8h_1a339614e2c6b3f80b5fe15771a41be17fa4eda5f72b331209ee9bc2d8fb2c02e7e" kindref="member">S1</ref> + ((prio) - 2U)))</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Deterministic mapping between active object priority and subscribed signal. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Each active object (except the last) subscribes to exactly one signal. The relationship is defined such that active object priority <computeroutput>prio</computeroutput> (starting from 2) maps to signal <computeroutput>S1 + (prio - 2)</computeroutput>. The last active object subscribes to all signals. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
